This repository is a port of the openwiki 0.4.3 deterministic engine core
(https://github.com/langchain-ai/openwiki, MIT License) onto the DeepSeek
Harness plugin surface: the resumable repository-page-job lifecycle, durable
page manifest + run state, the Grounded Claims store/session/runtime with
repository evidence resolution and `.claims/` sidecars, OKF v0.2 front matter
validation/repair + index synchronization + generated provenance, Mermaid and
wiki-link validation, and the wiki finalizer. The ported portions are
distributed under the same MIT license with their original copyright held by
their respective authors (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).

Parts of this repository are derived from DeepSeek Harness
(https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek.

